      "problem": "A particle moves along a circular path centered at $O$ in the $xy$-plane in the counterclockwise direction with a constant angular velocity of $2\\text{ rad/s}.$ Given that the object is at the position $(5,0)$ when $t=0,$ find the position function of the particle.",
